  "」？本机保存的配色与壁纸会一起清掉。已经导出成 .rsk 的文件不受影响。": "”? The colours and wallpaper saved on this device are deleted with it. Files already exported as .rsk are not affected.",
  "我的皮肤里可以应用 / 修改 / 导出任意一套；删除在主题栏的卡片上。.rsk 是一个 zip：内含 skin.json（配色 + 署名 + 签名）与壁纸，填了密码就整包加密，别人必须输入密码才能导入；动态壁纸（GIF / MP4）体积太大不打包进去，皮肤只记住它的地址，换机器需要重新上传。导出/导入都会存进上方主题栏（最多": "Apply / edit / export any skin from “My skins”; delete them on the cards in the theme bar. A .rsk is a zip holding skin.json (colours + author + signature) and the wallpaper; with a password the whole pack is encrypted and importers must enter it; animated wallpapers (GIF / MP4) are too large to bundle, so a skin only remembers the URL and you need to upload it again on another machine. Exports and imports both land in the theme bar above (up to",
  "DSP 初始化失败": "DSP initialisation failed",
