  "选一个主色 + 明暗，一键把背景 / 侧边栏 / 顶栏 / 卡片 / 播放栏 / 强调色整套铺好，之后还能逐项微调": "Pick a base colour and a scheme, and the background / sidebar / top bar / cards / player bar / accent are all set at once — fine-tune afterwards",
  "主色": "Base colour",
  "不知道选什么色？直接取背景图的主色，明暗也按这张图自动判断": "No idea which colour? Take the dominant colour straight from the background image; light/dark is decided from it too",
  "设置背景图后，可以直接从图里取主色": "Once a background image is set, you can sample its dominant colour",
